&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join ShopMy – Powering the Future of Digital Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ShopMy is transforming e-commerce by building the infrastructure for human-led curation at scale. We help brands run performance-driven creator programs while enabling top creators to monetize their influence and partner directly with the brands they love—driving discovery through trusted tastemakers and authentic recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ShopMy recently became a unicorn, raising at a $1.5B valuation with backing from Bessemer Venture Partners, Avenir Growth Capital, and Bain Capital Ventures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At ShopMy, you&#39;re building the future of human-led commerce for the world&#39;s best brands, tastemakers, and shoppers. You move fast and see immediate impact in your work, alongside accomplished teammates who are driven by helping find the world&#39;s best things. If you’re excited to help shape the future of curated commerce at the intersection of technology, culture, and taste, we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Brand Designer&lt;/strong&gt; at ShopMy, you’ll craft effective, visually striking communications that drive our brand and business impact. You’ll collaborate closely with Design, Brand Marketing, and Product Marketing teams to evolve and express the ShopMy brand across every touchpoint- from campaigns and content to marketing materials, email, and paid ads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role calls for both&lt;strong&gt; strategic vision &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;hands-on craft&lt;/strong&gt;;&amp;nbsp;balancing conceptual thinking with an obsession for detail and brand systems. As an individual contributor on the Product team, you’ll independently own and execute complex brand design projects while ensuring that every piece of communication, from an email design to a social ad to a brand deck, reflects the premium, elevated identity of ShopMy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own, concept, drive and execute complex design initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; for marketing campaigns, partnerships, and brand initiatives across all channels — including &lt;strong&gt;email, social, paid media, events, and out-of-home.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and produce marketing materials&lt;/strong&gt; such as sales decks, brand presentations, digital ads, and other assets that showcase ShopMy’s story and value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate brand strategy into campaign systems&lt;/strong&gt; — building scalable visual identities, templates, and processes that ensure consistency and excellence across all touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; with Brand Marketing, Product Marketing, and Product teams to bring cohesive, high-impact narratives to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate the craft&lt;/strong&gt; — create premium, modern, and engaging visuals that resonate with creators, brands, and consumers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor junior designers&lt;/strong&gt; and contribute to a high-performing, collaborative, and creative team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work directly with external partners and agencies&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure creative alignment, timelines and seamless collaboration across all initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Handle multiple projects gracefully&lt;/strong&gt; under tight timelines, maintaining creative excellence and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Sets You Up for Success&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in brand, marketing, or visual design — ideally within lifestyle, tech, or creative industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience concepting and executing holistic, cross-channel campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Figma&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Adobe Creative Suite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative eye for typography, color, layout, and photography — with an ability to elevate the premium feel of a brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in designing across a wide range of mediums — including &lt;strong&gt;email, digital ads, marketing collateral, and investor decks.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems-driven mindset: you think beyond single deliverables to scalable design frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with the ability to define creative direction even from open-ended briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills; can confidently sell ideas and lead creative discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and proactive, able to manage multiple priorities with clarity and calm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, optimistic, and full of creative energy. You naturally make work (and working) fun.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A base knowledge of ShopMy, who we are and what we’re creating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In compliance with New York Pay Transparency Law, the salary range for this position is as shown. We note that salary information as a general guideline only, actual compensation may vary from posting based on the offer for this role, including the scope and responsibilities of the position, relevant work experience, key skills, education, training and business considerations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;New York Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The provided salary range is base salary, exclusive of bonus potential or commission and is a good faith estimate of cash compensation. ShopMy is flexible pending candidate&#39;s experience and how our business needs evolve throughout the search. Every employee of ShopMy receives equity on top of cash compensation!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;ShopMy offers a bundle of benefits on top of being a great place to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teammates are provided benefits such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical &amp;amp; Dental Coverage at 70%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity in ShopMy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;14 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Social Stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technology Stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development Stipend&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k program (3% automated contribution from ShopMy!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellhub Membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company retreats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to monetize your influence- all employees build out a ShopMy page!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Birthday PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand new NYC HQ office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

